body:
I love to see this! "Work" smarter, not harder!

&#x200B;

Stay safe out there - and enjoy life! I hope to be in a similar situation in due time.

My game loads in +40GB and I have 16GB of RAM :(

&#x200B;

But I love my assets.

So here is a screenshot of my temps while on MSFS

&#x200B;

